          "note": "Classic dub techno percussion element. A tight rimshot or cross-stick, placed on offbeats, fed through delay with moderate feedback. The delay repetitions create a polyrhythmic pattern from a simple placement. The rimshot cuts through the murky mid-range and provides rhythmic definition without aggression."
