          "note": "Relentless 16th notes \\u2014 a constant stream of metallic ticking that provides the rhythmic density kuduro requires. Heavy velocity programming with accented hits creating subsidiary rhythmic patterns within the stream. The hat is thin, bright, high-passed aggressively \\u2014 just a sliver of metallic texture above the percussion. This 16th-note grid is essential: it's the fine temporal resolution against which the tresillo percussion and four-on-the-floor kick create their polyrhythmic tension."
