          "note": "Steady 8th notes \\u2014 the metronomic pulse that drives the track forward. Bright, metallic, 909 or 707-style. In darksynth, hats are more present and aggressive than in synthwave \\u2014 they cut through the distorted synth wall to maintain rhythmic definition. Some tracks run 16th notes (all steps) for more drive. Velocity variation on every other hit (louder on downbeats) adds human feel."
