      "lineage": "Direct Ancestors:\\nChopped & Screwed (DJ Screw, Houston hip-hop) - The foundational slowing and pitch-shifting techniques\\nIndustrial/EBM - Harsh textures and aggressive sound design\\nShoegaze - Wall-of-sound reverb processing and ethereal atmospherics\\nDark Ambient - Occult atmosphere and horror-inspired soundscapes\\nGothic Rock - Dark aesthetic and supernatural themes",
      "currentScene": "### Geographic Centers\\nLos Angeles - Hip-hop crossover artists (underground rap scene)\\nNew York - Original scene survivors and revival acts\\nEastern Europe - Strong witch house scenes in Russia, Poland\\nOnline communities - Discord servers, SoundCloud collectives"
