      "lineage": "Parent Genres: Ambient, Downtempo, Chillwave\\nEmerged: ~2010-2011  \\nGeographic Origin: Internet-native (primarily US-based online communities)\\nKey Influences: 1980s new age music, elevator music, smooth jazz, corporate background music, Japanese city pop",
