      "philosophy": "TENSION through SUBTRACTION and ADDITION. Build through removal to create tension. Hypnotic repetition\\u2014lock a groove for 16-64 bars before changing. Micro-variations\\u2014change one element at a time (hat velocity, kick placement). No fills for fills' sake\\u2014every change serves the groove. Polyrhythmic layering\\u2014stack 3-against-4 or 5-against-4 patterns subtly.",
