      "swing": 0,
      "description": "UK producer on Planet Mu who builds custom sequencers in Max/MSP to generate and disrupt Euclidean rhythmic patterns. Music is clinical, precise, and deliberately broken \\u2014 algorithmic club music where the system itself is the instrument.",
      "philosophy": "Generate patterns mathematically, then break them deliberately. Euclidean algorithms create the grid, then disruption creates the groove. Waveshaping applied to melodies \\u2014 pitch contours fold back on themselves. Meta-patterns modulate which drum pattern plays per bar. The sequencer is the instrument, not the synth. Asymmetric time divisions (3+3+3+3+4) create elastic tempo perception. Clinical precision with controlled imperfection.",
